<title>NETHERLANDS: ASMInternational confirms 1996 figures.</title>
<headline>ASMInternational confirms 1996 figures.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch semiconductor equipment maker ASM International confirmed on Tuesday it had made a net profit of 68.4 million guilders in 1996.</p>
<p>This seven percent dip in earnings compared to a 1995 net profit of 73.6 million guilders. The final figures did not differ from provisional figures published on February 21.</p>
<p>Net profit per share was confirmed at 2.03 guilders in 1996, versus 2.17 a year earlier.</p>
<p>1996 Revenues totalled 658.2 million guilders, down from 670.9 million in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
